"description":"WELLTHI: BUILD YOUR FINANCIAL FREEDOM\n\nMost finance apps show you what's happening. Wellthi helps you understand what it means for the life you want to build.\n\nFinancial freedom looks different for everyone. For some, it means getting out of debt. For others, it means building wealth, feeling less stressed about money, or having more choice in life. Wellthi helps you define what financial freedom means to you, see where you stand, and start moving toward it.\n\nSet your goals and discover your financial freedom number, a personalized number shaped by your finances, your priorities, and the future you want. Then go deeper with insights into your financial personality, advice tailored to your habits and mindset, support from people on a similar path, and access to financial professionals when you need it.\n\nThis isn't just money tracking. It's a more personal, connected way to build financial freedom.\n\nWITH WELLTHI APP, YOU CAN:\n\n• Discover your financial freedom number\n• Set goals and see where you stand\n• Understand your financial personality\n• Get advice tailored to your habits and mindset\n• Talk to financial professionals in the app\n• Track spending, savings, and net worth\n• Build momentum with a like-minded community\n• Turn financial insight into real-life progress\n\nSo whatever your next step, it's time to Get Wellthi.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.333330000000000126192389870993793010711669921875, "sellerUrl":"https://wellthiapp.com/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"91049984", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":6, "trackContentRating":"17+", "bundleId":"com.wellthiapp.app", "price":0.00, "userRatingCount":6}]
